- **Dates**: 10-night stay from December 15, 2024 (arrival/check-in) to December 25, 2024 (departure/check-out).
- **Budget**: 400-500 USD total for the stay (I interpreted this as the overall cost for 1 room with 2 adults, as family size wasn't specified; prices include taxes and are in USD. If you meant per night or have more details on family size/rooms, I can refine this).
